{:film
 "Start the app with a token and give hive the same one: `export FILMCRAFT_CONTROL_TOKEN=\"$(python3 -c 'import secrets;print(secrets.token_hex(32))')\"` then `filmcraft --control 9876` from a shell whose environment the hive JVM inherits, or keep the token in a file only you can read and set :apps {\"filmcraft\" {:token-ref {:scheme :file :path \"~/.private/filmcraft-control.token\"}}}."}
